OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged after bin set on fire
OL,4,Aoutside house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged following an
OL,7,Farson attack in County Tyrone.
OL,9,FPolice attended the scene of a fire at
OL,10,Fa property in Gortgonis Terrace,
OL,11,FCoalisland, at about 23:40 BST on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FThe fire was deliberately started in a
OL,15,Fbin which had been placed by a shed at
OL,16,Fthe property, police said. Some damage
OL,17,Fwas caused to the shed door, along with
OL,18,Fsmoke damage inside the shed, however,
OL,19,Fthere was no further damage reported.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
